> <div class=\"message\">Anybody else notice that the Beast Player's Guide seems to have answered/clarified the old question about how Pangaeans reach individual human soulscapes?</div> </div> </div> </div>Perhaps you could fill in the blanks?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T06:34:55-08:00","id":1193902,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/462775-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-werewolf-2e-edition?p=1193678#post1193678\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do the spirt of Akihabara and other \u2018nerd\u2019 places like what does the hisil look during a comic-con</div> </div> </div> </div>I imagine dozens of spirits looking like anime characters, but... off. Alien. Uncanny. As if they're drawn by someone who only heard of what they are, without actually watching the shows. And with characters mixed-and-matched. Most of them will be emotion spirits.<br /> <br /> And the spirit of Akihabara itself... since Wikipedia says that the name comes from Akiba, a deity who controls and suppresses fire, maybe Akiba is the spirit's name. Perhaps in the modern nights it has expanded the &quot;fires&quot; it controls to metaphorical ones, working to suppress the spirits surging from all those surging otaku culture.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T09:57:58-08:00","id":1193955,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/462775-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-werewolf-2e-edition?p=1193902#post1193902\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I imagine dozens of spirits looking like anime characters, but... off. Alien. Uncanny. As if they're drawn by someone who only heard of what they are, without actually watching the shows. And with characters mixed-and-matched. Most of them will be emotion spirits.<br /> <br /> And the spirit of Akihabara itself... since Wikipedia says that the name comes from Akiba, a deity who controls and suppresses fire, maybe Akiba is the spirit's name. Perhaps in the modern nights it has expanded the &amp;quot;fires&amp;quot; it controls to metaphorical ones, working to suppress the spirits surging from all those surging otaku culture.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why would the spirt do that? Akiharbara is supported be rabid otaku it makes more since for them to fan the \u2018flames\u2019 of rabid fans that sleep witch there waifu pillows.that is a interesting premise thoug akhiarbara spirt seems to be unsuccessful","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T13:23:45-08:00","id":1194021,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/462775-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-werewolf-2e-edition?p=1193814#post1193814\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Perhaps you could fill in the blanks?</div> </div> </div> </div>The BPG's presentation of the Astral as experienced through the Begotten lens treats the Temenos and the individual Oneiros as segments of the Bright Dream, so a traveler can navigate to the realms of an individual human soul through the same thematic linkage that gets them to any other place in the Temenos.<br /> <br /> This isn't contradicted by anything in the Mage 2e corebook, but the nearest thing presented there was the means of passing from the Oneiros to the Temenos (rather than the other way around) and the temporary bridge characters could construct between their individual Oneiroi through meditation, and the Beast corebook's final draft cut a reference to individual Oneiroi &quot;drift[ing] within the Temenos like corks bobbing on the surface of a roiling ocean&quot;; the Player's Guide provides a missing piece for explaining what &quot;finding their way to the target [from the Temenos] in the same way the Awakened can&quot; meant for Pangaean influence over the Astral.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T13:34:08-08:00","id":1194022,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/462775-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-werewolf-2e-edition?p=1193955#post1193955\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why would the spirt do that? Akiharbara is supported be rabid otaku it makes more since for them to fan the \u2018flames\u2019 of rabid fans that sleep witch there waifu pillows.that is a interesting premise thoug akhiarbara spirt seems to be unsuccessful</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what it is <i>now</i>, but Akihabara has been a place for way longer than it's been an otaku haunt. Its history could readily be represented by an oldfangled kami of trade and travel fighting a losing war against a relentless army of waifu spirits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13628-terrorforge","name":"Terrorforge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13628_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"185"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T15:03:56-08:00","id":1194057,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/462775-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-werewolf-2e-edition?p=1193955#post1193955\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why would the spirt do that? Akiharbara is supported be rabid otaku it makes more since for them to fan the \u2018flames\u2019 of rabid fans that sleep witch there waifu pillows.that is a interesting premise thoug akhiarbara spirt seems to be unsuccessful</div> </div> </div> </div>Think of it this way; if Akiba the firefighting god <i>wasn\u2019t</i> there to control the \u201cflames,\u201d imagine how much all the \u2018rabid\u2019 otaku-culture spirits could have wreaked havoc. Especially on all the poor otaku who feeds those things.<br /> <br /> EDIT: This way I wouldn\u2019t be surprised if Akiba (or at least, the spirit who inspired him) is a Forsaken totem. On the opposing side, a Fire-Touched pack has branched out to more esoteric fevers and faiths, fanning otaku culture to more extreme ends to empower the spirits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":12619,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","user":"21C Hermit","date":". 03-10-2018, 06:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-10T15:31:47-08:00","id":1194061,"title":"","content":"So anime watching fire touched do the fight other packs over waifus .Yang best girl forever does that do not agree shall be victims of the scarced hunt","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theony