to hunt down the spirit.<br /> <br /> If you want to be more creepy it could be fettered to one of the characters and occasionally possess them to lead the PCs on their hunt.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This is an even more excellent idea! Thank you! It makes so much more sense and is way easier just to find a spirit to help them out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/523-poseur","name":"Poseur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"375"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T04:30:45-07:00","id":1198609,"title":"","content":"How would a spirt of spectacer sports <br /> ?be not feed by people playing the damm game but be having millions of people watching it and sometimes damaging proptry ifluniceing people to spend government money on stupid stadiums when you need a new library I wonder what the Spirt of the NFL like during the Super Bowl poor werewolf's territory it happpens coincides with","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23952,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","user":"Konradleijon","date":". 03-23-2018, 07:33 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T22:34:58-07:00","id":1198963,"title":"","content":"Is it possible to choose to fail a breaking point roll?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1