t--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But they can be useful what if they want a special hooman day for arcane purposes</div> </div> </div> </div>Silver Wolf is big on purity, and doesn't seem to think there are such things as special humans. Rabid Wolf is more concerned with the Hisil, and would be more likely to mate with a spirit if possible.<br /> <br /> Like I said, however, there's no mechanics for this. If you want to do it in your game you can have the Firstborn knocking up the entire western hemisphere, you'll just have to do the crunch work yourself.<br /> <br /> Or ask someone else to do it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 05-24-2018, 02:05 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T11:12:58-07:00","id":1221768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/462775-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-werewolf-2e-edition?p=1221767#post1221767\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Silver Wolf is big on purity, and doesn't seem to think there are such things as special humans. Rabid Wolf is more concerned with the Hisil, and would be more likely to mate with a spirit if possible.<br /> <br /> Like I said, however, there's no mechanics for this. If you want to do it in your game you can have the Firstborn knocking up the entire western hemisphere, you'll just have to do the crunch work yourself.<br /> W <br /> <br /> Or ask someone else to do it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why wouldn\u2019t silver wolf impregnate someone it could be like the crow from Navajo mythology and they could just eat a special fern and now there preggers","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T11:18:57-07:00","id":1221770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Konradleijon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/462775-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-werewolf-2e-edition?p=1221768#post1221768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why wouldn\u2019t silver wolf impregnate someone it could be like the crow from Navajo mythology and they could just eat a special fern and now there preggers</div> </div> </div> </div>'The totem of the Ivory Claws is a self-righteous and sneering deity in every surviving tale told by the Tribes of the Moon. A true wolf cannot hate, but a god can. This god certainly does.'<br /> <br /> Humans aren't his type, and mixing with one would be some sort of extreme degradation on his behalf.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T11:20:44-07:00","id":1221772,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/462775-ask-a-simple-question-get-a-simple-answer-werewolf-2e-edition?p=1221770#post1221770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 'The totem of the Ivory Claws is a self-righteous and sneering deity in every surviving tale told by the Tribes of the Moon. A true wolf cannot hate, but a god can. This god certainly does.'<br /> <br /> Humans aren't his type, and mixing with one would be some sort of extreme degradation on his behalf.</div> </div> </div> </div>Alright so what about rabid wolf?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23952-konradleijon","name":"Konradleijon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23952_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-24T11:31:16-07:00","